size math in gestures.ts applyItemMove edge branch — opposite edge fixed, center shifts by HALF dragged distance along rotated axis, min clamp, cutout↔solid patch mapping; (2) hit-test regressions (edge handles must not steal rotate/corner/raster-move; 44px conversion; wheel/keyboard include decal solids, never pattern solids); (3) state/back-compat in state.ts + designer-app.tsx (add-item validation, undo/redo identity, duplicate/copy, item cap, no resurrection of full-clothing solids); (4) More sheet px-vs-percent Size, ratio commit round-trip, field visibility, useEffect nonce resync.\n\nThe prompt embeds the full diff base d5a8ae7 → HEAD 71d839e (README, docs/roblox-clothing-designer-design.md, src/editor/state.ts, src/editor/ui/{designer-app.tsx,editor-screen.tsx,gestures.ts,workspace.tsx,sheets.tsx}, src/styles.css, tests/unit/editor-state.test.ts, tests/browser/{gestures.test.ts,ui.test.ts,projects.test.ts}).\n\n## Files read in full (current HEAD)\n**src/editor/ui/gestures.ts (879 lines)**: FootprintGeometry.edgeHandles (lines 15-26); footprintGeometry maps edgeHandles at map(±halfWidth,0)/(0,±halfHeight) (74-79); scale/rotate handles clamped to bounds inset 16, edge handles NOT clamped; ROTATE_HANDLE_OFFSET=36 (28); MIN_ITEM_SCALE=0.01 (102); HANDLE_SCREEN_RADIUS=22 (103); directlyEditable (107-115) = visible && (raster|cutout || solid.placement===\"decal\"); editableTransform (117-135) solid decal→transform else null; startItemInteraction (300-409) order: rotate (320) → corner scale (336) → edge (355-383, gated `selectedLayer.kind !== \"raster\"`, nearest within tolerance=handleRadiusCanvasPx) → interior move if hitId===selectedId (385-401) → tapPending; handleRadiusCanvasPx = 22/(rect.scale*viewport.scale) (252-255, correct screen→canvas conversion); applyItemMove EDGE BRANCH (552-583): rad=gesture.rotationDeg; localX=dx*cos+dy*sin, localY=-dx*sin+dy*cos; minHalf=MIN_ITEM_SCALE/2; left/right: direction=±1, half=max(minHalf, direction*localX), shiftX=direc